From bc8c25ec8a48fb3363a7d7134ac6c440c14b5644 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Mar 2026 08:50:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: add quiz creator/editor to manager page

Add ability to create, edit, and delete quizzes directly from the manager
page with drag-and-drop image upload support. Quizzes are saved as JSON
files to config/quizz/ and images are stored in config/quizz/images/.

- New QuizzEditor component with full quiz authoring UI
- Socket events for CRUD operations (save, get, delete)
- HTTP image serving on the socket server port
- Edit/Delete buttons on quiz list, Create Quiz button
- Dockerfile updated for images directory

https://claude.ai/code/session_01Eb3wPPL8wA762b6ez6cjXW
